WEBVTT

00:12:59.329 --> 00:13:01.246
an alternative to toxic masculinity.

00:13:01.496 --> 00:13:07.246
Interesting as a phrase, because I'm
not sure that phrase is helpful.

00:13:07.412 --> 00:13:09.537
I am so with you. I hate the phrase.

00:13:09.746 --> 00:13:12.204
It's it's always bothered me
just at a basic level,

00:13:12.204 --> 00:13:15.579
because it seems to imply that masculinity
is inherently toxic

00:13:15.912 --> 00:13:17.454
as opposed to what you said,

00:13:17.454 --> 00:13:21.704
which is there's a there's a brand or a
flavor of masculinity that can be toxic.

00:13:21.704 --> 00:13:24.204
And I guess I came to wondering,

00:13:24.204 --> 00:13:27.371
is that part of the reason
why why you see

00:13:27.371 --> 00:13:29.912
so many men motivated to armor up at work

00:13:29.912 --> 00:13:32.787
because they have to keep proving their
strength over and over again?